# __NAME__

Spring Boot 3 (Java 17) with Gradle: a REST controller, Actuator and MVC tests.

- Run: Java menu > Run Application, or `gradle bootRun`
- Test: `gradle test`
- Try it: http://localhost:8080/hello?name=you and http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

The project has no Gradle wrapper yet: with Gradle installed run `gradle wrapper` once and the Run bar will use `gradlew`.
